  "label": "User projected onto the scene of loading a dishwasher with missing parts",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual scene of the man loading dishes into the dishwasher, which is humorously labeled as 'free dishwasher' with 'missing parts'. This projection implies the user is identifying with the experience of receiving a free item that is incomplete or defective, a common consumer frustration. The scene (dishwasher_loading) serves as the anchor for this projection, as it visually represents the ironic situation described by the text. The user is not explicitly addressed with deictic pronouns like 'you' or 'me', but the meme's overall intent and relatable scenario create an implicit projection where the viewer sees themselves in the situation.",
